THIRD-PARTY NOTICES for the servtuner release archive

The archive carries these third-party works, unmodified, each under its own licence. Licences
were read from each project's repository on 2026-11-26.
Container images also hold operating-system packages under their own licences; each image's
/usr/share/doc (or the project's image build) lists them.

The archive carries no price data: operators supply the token-price datasheet themselves.

servtuner's own images are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

